---
// index.astro — Page d'accueil
// Assets attendus :
//   src/assets/aerial.jpg      → photo aérienne
//   src/assets/pool-jacuzzi.jpg → piscine & jacuzzi
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Les Gîtes du Domaine</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>

<!-- ─── NAVIGATION ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<nav>
    <a href="/" class="logo">Le Domaine</a>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/gites/la-garenne">La Garenne</a></li>
        <li><a href="/gites/le-logis-de-feydoux">Le logis de Feydoux</a></li>
        <li><a href="/region">La Région</a></li>
        <li><a href="/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/gites/la-garenne" class="cta-nav">Réserver</a>
</nav>

<!-- ─── HERO — PHOTO AÉRIENNE ──────────────────────────────── -->
<header class="hero">
    <img
        src="/src/assets/feydoux/aerial.jpg"
        alt="Vue aérienne du domaine"
        class="hero-img"
    />
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Bienvenue au domaine</p>
        <h1>Un refuge<br /><em>hors du temps</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Deux gîtes de caractère au cœur d'une nature préservée</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/gites/la-garenne" class="btn-primary">Découvrir les gîtes</a>
            <a href="/region" class="btn-ghost">Explorer la région</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-hint">↓</div>
</header>

<!-- ─── SECTION INTRO ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="intro">
    <div class="intro-text">
        <span class="label">Notre histoire</span>
        <h2>Deux gîtes,<br />une même âme</h2>
        <p>
            Nichés au sein d'un domaine familial, nos deux gîtes indépendants offrent
            intimité, confort et authenticité. Que vous veniez en couple, en famille
            ou entre amis, vous trouverez ici un espace pour souffler, rêver et
            vous ressourcer.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-stats">
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-num">2</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Gîtes privatifs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-num">1</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Piscine chauffée</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-num">1</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Jacuzzi extérieur</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-num">∞</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Souvenirs à créer</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION GÎTES ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="gites">
    <span class="label centered">Nos hébergements</span>
    <h2 class="centered">Choisissez votre séjour</h2>

    <div class="gites-grid">
        <!-- Gîte 1 -->
        <article class="gite-card">
            <div class="card-img-wrap">
                <!-- Remplacez par l'image du gîte 1 -->
                <div class="card-img-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>Photo Gîte 1</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-badge">Piscine privée</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>La Garenne</h3>
                <p class="card-capacity">👥 2–6 personnes &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🛏 3 chambres</p>
                <p class="card-desc">
                    Ancien corps de ferme rénové avec goût. Terrasse ombragée,
                    piscine chauffée et vue sur les vignes.
                </p>
                <div class="card-tags">
                    <span>Piscine</span><span>Barbecue</span><span>Wifi</span>
                </div>
                <a href="/gites/la-garenne" class="btn-card">Voir le gîte →</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Gîte 2 -->
        <article class="gite-card">
            <div class="card-img-wrap">
                <!-- Remplacez par l'image du gîte 2 -->
                <div class="card-img-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>Photo Gîte 2</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-badge">Jacuzzi privatif</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Le logis de Feydoux</h3>
                <p class="card-capacity">👥 2–4 personnes &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🛏 2 chambres</p>
                <p class="card-desc">
                    Cocon romantique au bord du ruisseau. Jacuzzi extérieur
                    sous les étoiles et décoration soignée.
                </p>
                <div class="card-tags">
                    <span>Jacuzzi</span><span>Cheminée</span><span>Wifi</span>
                </div>
                <a href="/gites/le-logis-de-feydoux" class="btn-card">Voir le gîte →</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION PISCINE & JACUZZI ─────────────────────────── -->
<section class="pool-section">
    <img
        src="/src/assets/pool-jacuzzi.jpg"
        alt="Piscine du domaine et jacuzzi privatif"
        class="pool-img"
    />
    <div class="pool-overlay"></div>
    <div class="pool-content">
        <span class="label light">Détente & bien-être</span>
        <h2>L'eau comme art<br /><em>de vivre</em></h2>
        <p>
            Plongez dans la piscine chauffée ou glissez-vous dans le jacuzzi
            sous un ciel étoilé. Des moments de pur bonheur qui font de ce séjour
            une expérience inoubliable.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION RÉGION ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="region-teaser">
    <div class="region-text">
        <span class="label">Autour du domaine</span>
        <h2>Une région qui<br />ne demande qu'à<br />être explorée</h2>
        <p>
            Marchés provençaux, sentiers de randonnée, caves à visiter,
            villages perchés… Chaque journée réserve une nouvelle découverte
            à quelques minutes du domaine.
        </p>
        <a href="/region" class="btn-primary">Découvrir la région</a>
    </div>
    <div class="region-mosaic">
        <!-- Placeholders — remplacez par de vraies photos de la région -->
        <div class="mosaic-item m1"><span>Marchés</span></div>
        <div class="mosaic-item m2"><span>Randonnées</span></div>
        <div class="mosaic-item m3"><span>Villages</span></div>
        <div class="mosaic-item m4"><span>Gastronomie</span></div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── FOOTER ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<footer>
    <div class="footer-top">
        <div class="footer-brand">
            <p class="logo">Le Domaine</p>
            <p>Des séjours d'exception,<br />des souvenirs pour la vie.</p>
        </div>
        <nav class="footer-nav">
            <h4>Hébergements</h4>
            <a href="/gites/la-garenne">La Garenne</a>
            <a href="/gites/le-logis-de-feydoux">le logis de Feydoux</a>
        </nav>
        <nav class="footer-nav">
            <h4>Informations</h4>
            <a href="/region">La Région</a>
            <a href="/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="footer-contact">
            <h4>Contact</h4>
            <p>contact@ledomaine.fr</p>
            <p>+33 6 00 00 00 00</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>© 2026 Le Domaine — Tous droits réservés</p>
    </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
    /* ── RESET & BASE ── */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
        --cream:   #f5f0e8;
        --stone:   #e8e0d0;
        --warm:    #c8a96e;
        --dark:    #1a1612;
        --mid:     #5a4a38;
        --light:   #faf7f2;

        --font-display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
        --font-body:    'Jost', sans-serif;

        --section-pad: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
        background: var(--light);
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.7;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.15;
    }

    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

    img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

    .label {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: .7rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--warm);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .label.centered { display: block; text-align: center; }
    .label.light { color: rgba(245,240,232,.7); }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: 1.25rem clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        background: rgba(26,22,18,.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    nav .logo {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--cream);
        letter-spacing: .05em;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    nav ul {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    nav ul a {
        font-size: .8rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: .06em;
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.75);
        transition: color .2s;
    }
    nav ul a:hover { color: var(--warm); }

    .cta-nav {
        font-size: .75rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--dark);
        background: var(--warm);
        padding: .55rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
        transition: opacity .2s;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .cta-nav:hover { opacity: .85; }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
        position: relative;
        height: 100svh;
        min-height: 600px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        transform-origin: center;
        animation: zoomSlow 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes zoomSlow {
        from { transform: scale(1); }
        to   { transform: scale(1.06); }
    }

    .hero-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(
                to top,
                rgba(15,11,8,.85) 0%,
                rgba(15,11,8,.3) 50%,
                rgba(15,11,8,.15) 100%
        );
    }

    .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
        max-width: 720px;
        animation: fadeUp .9s ease both;
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
        to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
        font-size: .72rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--warm);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-content h1 {
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
        color: var(--cream);
        line-height: 1.05;
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .hero-content h1 em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--warm);
    }

    .hero-sub {
        font-size: clamp(.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.7);
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        max-width: 480px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--warm);
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: .8rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: .85rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
        transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { opacity: .88; transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .btn-ghost {
        display: inline-block;
        border: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,.4);
        color: var(--cream);
        font-size: .8rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: .1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: .85rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
        transition: border-color .2s, background .2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover {
        border-color: var(--warm);
        background: rgba(200,169,110,.08);
    }

    .scroll-hint {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 2rem;
        right: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.4);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        animation: bob 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes bob {
        0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
        50%      { transform: translateY(8px); }
    }

    /* ── INTRO ── */
    .intro {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 4rem;
        align-items: center;
        padding: var(--section-pad) clamp(1.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
        background: var(--light);
    }

    .intro-text h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
        color: var(--dark);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .intro-text p {
        color: var(--mid);
        font-size: 1rem;
        max-width: 440px;
    }

    .intro-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 2px;
        background: var(--stone);
    }

    .stat {
        background: var(--light);
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: .4rem;
        transition: background .2s;
    }
    .stat:hover { background: var(--cream); }

    .stat-num {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 3.2rem;
        color: var(--warm);
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .stat-label {
        font-size: .75rem;
        letter-spacing: .1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--mid);
    }

    /* ── GÎTES ── */
    .gites {
        background: var(--cream);
        padding: var(--section-pad) clamp(1.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    }

    .gites h2.centered {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .gites-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .gite-card {
        background: var(--light);
        border-radius: 4px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    }
    .gite-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(26,22,18,.12);
    }

    .card-img-wrap {
        position: relative;
        height: 260px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card-img-placeholder {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4c4a8 0%, #b8a882 100%);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: rgba(26,22,18,.4);
        font-size: .85rem;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
    }

    .card-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: 1rem;
        left: 1rem;
        background: var(--dark);
        color: var(--warm);
        font-size: .65rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: .35rem .8rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .card-body {
        padding: 1.8rem;
    }

    .card-body h3 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        margin-bottom: .4rem;
    }

    .card-capacity {
        font-size: .82rem;
        color: var(--mid);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card-desc {
        font-size: .92rem;
        color: var(--mid);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .card-tags {
        display: flex;
        gap: .5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card-tags span {
        font-size: .7rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        border: 1px solid var(--stone);
        padding: .25rem .75rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        color: var(--mid);
    }

    .btn-card {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: .8rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .06em;
        color: var(--dark);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--warm);
        padding-bottom: 2px;
        transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
    }
    .btn-card:hover { color: var(--warm); }

    /* ── POOL ── */
    .pool-section {
        position: relative;
        height: clamp(400px, 65vh, 700px);
        overflow: hidden;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .pool-img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
    }

    .pool-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(
                to right,
                rgba(15,11,8,.82) 0%,
                rgba(15,11,8,.35) 60%,
                rgba(15,11,8,.1) 100%
        );
    }

    .pool-content {
        position: relative;
        padding: 3rem clamp(1.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
        max-width: 560px;
    }

    .pool-content h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        color: var(--cream);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .pool-content h2 em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--warm);
    }

    .pool-content p {
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.75);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }

    /* ── RÉGION TEASER ── */
    .region-teaser {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        min-height: 520px;
        background: var(--light);
    }

    .region-text {
        padding: var(--section-pad) clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .region-text h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .region-text p {
        color: var(--mid);
        font-size: .95rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        max-width: 420px;
    }

    .region-mosaic {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 3px;
        background: var(--stone);
    }

    .mosaic-item {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8b898 0%, #a89070 100%);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
        font-size: .72rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: rgba(26,22,18,.55);
        transition: filter .3s;
    }
    .mosaic-item:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }

    .m1 { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg,#d4c4a8,#baa880); }
    .m2 { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg,#c0b09080,#a89070); }
    .m3 { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg,#b8a88080,#c4b490); }
    .m4 { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg,#ccc0a0,#b0a080); }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
        background: var(--dark);
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.65);
    }

    .footer-top {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;
        gap: 3rem;
        padding: 4rem clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,.08);
    }

    .footer-brand .logo {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--cream);
        margin-bottom: .75rem;
    }

    .footer-brand p { font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.7; }

    .footer-nav h4,
    .footer-contact h4 {
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: .7rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--warm);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .footer-nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: .6rem;
    }

    .footer-nav a {
        font-size: .88rem;
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.6);
        transition: color .2s;
    }
    .footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--cream); }

    .footer-contact p { font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.9; }

    .footer-bottom {
        padding: 1.5rem clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
        font-size: .75rem;
        color: rgba(245,240,232,.3);
    }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        nav ul { display: none; }

        .intro {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .region-teaser {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .region-mosaic {
            min-height: 320px;
        }

        .footer-top {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 580px) {
        .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; }

        .footer-top {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
